From b9d62de0085031d14de776520d933f371929ae6a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 07:22:10 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] v2.5.9: trusted-tester batch - Warden geo cache, AiMesh node,
 Addons rail, Policy Routing usability + decoupling, fqdn set persistence

- rwarden: per-set add-only cache replay with logging (one-shot ipset restore aborted on the
  rw_threat maxelem header drift and left every country set empty), never save an empty set over a
  good cache entry, maxelem 262144 on rw_g_*, stats geo_e/geo_empty; Warden page tile shows loaded
  prefixes and goes amber on an empty country list.
- httpd: rdev_node_classify() reads CM_CLIENT_TABLE by realMacAddr and decodes re_path, so a
  wireless-backhaul AiMesh node shows its band (or MLO) instead of Wired; backhaul-STA phantom rows
  folded; "node" JSON field + AiMesh Node chip on Reaper_Devices.
- www: one shared ReaperAddons parser (reaper_util.js) feeds both the dashboard and shell rails.
- reaper_fw: rfw_field() truncation now rejects+logs (was silently cut), RFW_VAL_MAX 2048,
  dnsmasq emitter continues on a second ipset= line, fqdn sets saved to /jffs/reaper_fw/sets by the
  resolver and replayed at create; reaper_fw_sets_only() materialises object sets without chains and
  is called by start_reaper_pbr() (policy routing no longer needs the firewall engine on).
- Reaper_Firewall: Modify/Save/Cancel on all eight lists; object value is a multi-line box.
- Reaper_VPNRouting: rule Modify, inline Domain lists card, relabelled selectors + VPN Director hint.
- Tools_OtherSettings: Reaper interface theme option removed from the Tweaks page.
- 24 new dict keys in all 25 packs (lockstep 6707), translated.
